{"t":"Arthei's Descent into Vampirism II (Book)","s":"arthei-s-descent-into-vampirism-ii-book-6a5da","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Old_Piece_of_Paper_8b58e7.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Untitled</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Old Piece of Paper\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Old_Piece_of_Paper_8b58e7.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Vengoth%2FCastle\">Vengoth Castle</a></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"blurb\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Short Description</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Arthei\">Arthei</a>'s future does not look very bright. Something strange happens.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"author\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Author</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Marziel\">Marziel</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatedpages\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Related Articles</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/quest/blood-brothers-quest\">Blood Brothers Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Marziel\">Marziel</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Arthei\">Arthei</a>, Kala</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Related books</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prevbook\">Previous Book</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"nextbook\">Next Book</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prevbook\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Arthei%27s%20Descent%20into%20Vampirism%20I%20%28Book%29\">Arthei's Descent into Vampirism I</a></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"nextbook\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Arthei%27s%20Descent%20into%20Vampirism%20III%20%28Book%29\">Arthei's Descent into Vampirism III</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"returnpage\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Return to</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>Vengoth Library.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.40<br/>December 10, 2008<br/>Winter Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Libraries <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It can be found in a <a href=\"#/wiki/Pile%20of%20Bones%20%28Quest%29\">Pile of Bones (Quest)</a> underneath a <a href=\"#/wiki/Pile%20of%20Bones\">Pile of Bones</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32964,31471,2\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32964, 31471, 2)</a>.Part of the <a href=\"#/quest/blood-brothers-quest\">Blood Brothers Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-text\">\n<blockquote class=\"book\"><p><br/>&lt;this is a ripped page, probably from a diary&gt;<br/>IV. 3rd<br/>Arthei is not getting better... neither is he getting worse, his state has been the same for the last days. We have established a regular watch plan now during the night so that Kala can get some rest. I have not given up hope, yet, but things are not looking good. It is hard to believe that the poor creature in the bed is my brother. I fear that only a miracle can help him now.<br/><br/>IV. 5th<br/>I cannot put into words yet what happened last night... and neither do I know whether it is good... or evil? I have to think about it...</p></blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["blood-brothers-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"blood-brothers-quest","quest":"Blood Brothers Quest","step":"5-5","n":36,"title":"Livro II no topo da torre (opcional)","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":32964,"y":31471,"z":2,"label":"Livro II (Pile of Bones, topo da torre)"}]}],"spots":[{"x":32964,"y":31471,"z":2,"text":"It can be found in a Pile of Bones (Quest) underneath a Pile of Bones here .Part of the Blood Brothers Quest ."}]}}